Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.84,0:00:01.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是Purple 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.66,0:00:05.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Yellow22 Delta確認有發光信號
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.17,0:00:07.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在前去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:08.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Bravo收到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.24,0:00:13.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是那個吧 有聯絡說被搶走的穿梭機
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.13,0:00:16.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用完扔在這裡了嗎 有一手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.72,0:00:19.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認船內狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:24.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:26.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.26,0:00:31.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼搶走穿梭機那些人的下落呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:36.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在主要由葛拉斯茍隊展開搜查 但仍未…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.82,0:00:43.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 偏偏假扮拉克絲 克萊茵來奪取穿梭機
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.27,0:00:45.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是大膽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.11,0:00:49.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 營救出的穿梭機駕駛員和基地的人們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.76,0:00:54.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,都說真的是一模一樣 連聲音都是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.12,0:00:58.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之盡快找到他們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:01.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然還不知道是不是聯合的伎倆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:03.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但不管是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.03,0:01:06.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼做的理由只有一個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:10.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是要藉她的形象擾亂PLANT
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:11.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:14.40,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(654,630)}黑海沿岸都市 迪奧基亞 ZAFT軍基地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:17.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被人這樣利用 那位善良的拉克絲會有多麼難過呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:18.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.59,0:01:24.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,務必在他們開始行動引起奇怪的騷動之前抓住他們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:25.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:27.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.72,0:01:36.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 該慶幸他們分開了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:41.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲 克萊茵和基拉 大和
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閉ざした過去が今
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸を搖さぶるから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,求めるほど遠く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,置き去りの心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らは生きるほど何かを失って
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,それでも明日への
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,夢を捨てたくない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみの理由でさえも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,つよく抱きしめていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,通りすぎた季節のその先に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,なにがあるのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕たちは迷いながら
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,たどり着く場所を探しつづけ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しくて涙流しても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつか輝きにかえて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Couse I never do not stopping my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PHASE-27  未傳達的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:20.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:21.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:24.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,得分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:31.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我並非那種老對過去事情斤斤計較的人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:36.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但也不會一直對失敗這麼寬容
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.01,0:03:37.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.01,0:03:41.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次強化人的損失也是沒辦法的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:44.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,上了戰場敵人也會拚命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:48.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事情不會總如人願
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:50.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:54.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  目的必須完成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:57.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一切命令都只為需要而下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.33,0:04:00.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是在玩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:03.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 這我完全瞭解
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:07.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白的話 就趕快解決
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.05,0:04:09.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,按我說的去做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:14.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,否則 這裡的計劃也會受影響
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.58,0:04:20.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘Minerva正作為正義的同伴 ZAFT的象徵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:22.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,被反聯合勢力推上台
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.87,0:04:25.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,完全變成了英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.01,0:04:29.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 明明是協調者的船
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.04,0:04:33.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,會這樣不都是因為他們節節獲勝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:35.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:38.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,民眾是愚蠢的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:41.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絲毫不考慮未來
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:45.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只歡迎現在對自己有利的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:47.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,的確如此
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:49.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何如此容易被欺騙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:56.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那些協調者怎麼可能真心對我們自然人伸出援手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.54,0:04:59.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反正遲早會翻臉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:04.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以那艘船是個麻煩 很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:06.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再讓它囂張下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.71,0:05:09.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下次一定要幹掉它 尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:14.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們就是為此而存在的 別忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:18.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我銘記於心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是您指示的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:25.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,報告遲了 很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:26.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:31.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩不斷 我也沒那個心情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.68,0:05:35.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思 讓你做像間諜一樣的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:39.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪裡 艦長也有身為FAITH的立場
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:43.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也理解您的難處
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.81,0:05:47.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.60,0:05:51.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的話我能問一些問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:54.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:58.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可以 能回答的我盡量回答
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.71,0:06:07.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉在上次大戰後期脫離ZAFT
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:10.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和脫離地球軍的Archangel一起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:14.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與兩軍作戰 這已是人盡皆知的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:19.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 他本人對此也毫不隱瞞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:25.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 知道此事的狄蘭達爾議長親自認可他歸隊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,並授予他為FAITH
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.53,0:06:29.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 這次的事…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:38.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是對他還有某種懷疑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:46.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們認為FAITH就是特別受到議長信任的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:48.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也遵從其指示
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:50.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 如果…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.70,0:06:53.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那樣的 露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:57.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你會這麼想也不奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:07:02.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這次的目標只是針對Archangel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:10.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他是個認真而富有正義感的好人 這我毫不懷疑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:14.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不會有間諜或者背叛的可能性
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:18.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,估計也沒人會這麼想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.95,0:07:24.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但之前那艘Archangel又怎麼樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:28.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實在上次大戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.65,0:07:31.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,它和拉克絲 克萊茵一起與失控的兩軍作戰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:33.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阻止了戰爭
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.48,0:07:36.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但現在呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.84,0:07:39.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布打算加入聯合的陣營
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:41.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,它就突然出現擄走國家元首
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.44,0:07:45.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前幾天還做了那種事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:46.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:49.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想做什麼完全無法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.41,0:07:55.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,它到底怎麼了 這才是現在最令人想知道的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.93,0:07:56.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.19,0:08:00.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭也是因此而離艦的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.55,0:08:06.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但他仍然相信那艘船的乘員和奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:09.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其實他並不想戰鬥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.81,0:08:16.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以希望你能理解 行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:20.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 既然如此我也…嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.70,0:08:22.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 辛苦你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.07,0:08:26.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事就到此結束 可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:27.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.04,0:08:32.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所監控的內容 出了這個房間你就忘掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:36.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 那個拉克絲 克萊茵呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:39.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了 還有什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.44,0:08:42.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在PLANT的那個拉克絲怎麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.30,0:08:50.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且為什麼真正的她險些被協調者殺害？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:53.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.07,0:08:55.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.76,0:08:57.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:02.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一切按您的指示 打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.41,0:09:25.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,複查的數據呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.59,0:09:26.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請稍等 馬上拿來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:30.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 氧氣罩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.81,0:09:32.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.49,0:09:35.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:36.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請退下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:40.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了我也不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.91,0:09:42.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.01,0:09:44.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是說過因藥物產生的各種影響
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.31,0:09:47.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她的身體情況完全不清楚嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:49.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.21,0:09:53.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定期間內如果不進行某種特殊處理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:56.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎會無法維持身體機能
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.85,0:10:01.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底需要什麼 為什麼突然變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:04.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在完全不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:06.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:08.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:11.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.55,0:10:14.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:18.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真…保護
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.24,0:10:29.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,關於這種狀況的藥物研究
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.97,0:10:33.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自然人比我們要先進得多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:35.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:37.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.34,0:10:47.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 要帶那女孩一起走嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:52.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 說要和那研究所的數據一起送去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:57.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 聽醫生說她狀況不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:10:59.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這也報告了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.06,0:11:04.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,回答是 那就更需要移送到設備優良的地方去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.58,0:11:06.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.71,0:11:20.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如上所述 作戰很單純
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.01,0:11:24.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但這樣真的能順利進行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:29.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說到底 那個情報的可信度到底有多少
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.13,0:11:33.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,撒網當然可以 Minerva如果…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.39,0:11:38.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 事到如今說這些也只會讓人為難
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:43.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誰會靠猜謎出動軍隊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:47.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva絕對會選擇這條航線前往直布羅陀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:50.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該也差不多要出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:57.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這件事我和上校已經好好確認過了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:12:01.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們考慮之後的事就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:05.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉大人真稱職啊 決斷也快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:10.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布有這樣的領導人實在難得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.71,0:12:12.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 這點事不值一提
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.41,0:12:15.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然是個艱鉅的作戰任務
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:18.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但必須完成
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而我們奧布軍一定能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 這樣我軍會…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:26.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就能消滅Minerva的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.98,0:12:30.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我國的軍事實力也能得被世界各國所認可吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.64,0:12:33.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能做到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.79,0:12:38.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,身為軍人 服從命令就是我們的責任
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:42.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.58,0:12:43.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:47.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我認為這次那艘奇怪的戰艦不會出現
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.81,0:12:53.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但萬一出現了 也沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:13:00.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您說過那是敵軍和假冒的首相吧 尤拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.62,0:13:05.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:07.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.94,0:13:14.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,做那種莫名奇妙的事 妄想擾亂我軍士氣的船艦只會是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:17.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣吧 戶高上校
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:19.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你也下令攻擊了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.79,0:13:28.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:30.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戶高上校
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.05,0:13:32.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:54.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,瑪德克先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:56.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喲 小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.24,0:13:58.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:02.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,跑來這種地方會嫁不出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.68,0:14:04.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊 真失禮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:05.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,才不在乎呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.15,0:14:12.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種囉哩八嗦老是抱怨的男人還輪不到他甩我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.17,0:14:14.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.22,0:14:17.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 又要請你多多關照了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.01,0:14:21.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 樂意奉陪 小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.49,0:14:24.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍在克列塔島部署？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.49,0:14:27.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 果然又要對Minerva…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.55,0:14:29.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 雖然沒有確實証據
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.05,0:14:32.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,線人也認為是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.39,0:14:37.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,認定Minerva會前往直布羅陀而設下的埋伏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合也開始著急了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.77,0:14:41.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:43.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.10,0:14:45.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.69,0:14:47.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,過得好嗎 和艾爾斯曼怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:48.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:54.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,暗號電報
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.26,0:14:59.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva從馬爾馬拉海出發 南下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.43,0:15:05.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這下沒錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.21,0:15:10.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍會在克列塔島再次與Minerva發生衝突
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:32.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉到艦影
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:36.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離60 11點鐘方向
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.99,0:15:39.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全員準備起錨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.81,0:15:42.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複 全員準備起錨
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:44.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:49.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.65,0:15:54.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 這裡好像…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:56.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,前方有艦影
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.67,0:15:58.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,航母1 護衛艦3
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:03.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘地球軍航母呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.55,0:16:04.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法確認
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.95,0:16:06.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嚴密監視 趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.37,0:16:09.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不會只有奧布的船艦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.50,0:16:10.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.42,0:16:13.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽 下令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.73,0:16:14.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.06,0:16:16.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:17.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到搭乘機內待命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:23.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,重複 駕駛員到搭乘機內待命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.27,0:16:30.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總覺得忘記了什麼重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.63,0:16:34.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊…重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.29,0:16:36.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以說不知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.73,0:16:40.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第二第四小隊 出擊待命中
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:50.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第一第三第五小隊 出擊完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.67,0:16:53.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,放出Impulse和Saviour
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.59,0:16:54.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:57.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舵30 取西面航線
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.15,0:17:00.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse和Saviour出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:08.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標距離主炮射程還有40
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.89,0:17:11.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva上MS的出擊情況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:12.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒出來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:17.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 讓他們淋個蜂式彈雨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:21.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,炮手 蜂式彈齊射 發射
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.13,0:17:26.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,炮擊來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:29.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS停止出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.52,0:17:31.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迴避的同時迎擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:51.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,表面裝甲被貫穿到第二層
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡 自鍛破片的彈雨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.54,0:17:55.09,注释SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,SFF: Self-forging fragment 反裝甲霰彈
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.71,0:17:57.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,損管維修 右舵20
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:01.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,9點鐘方向又出現奧布船艦 數量3
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.00,0:18:05.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.71,0:18:10.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,2點鐘方向上空奧布軍Murasame 9
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.61,0:18:13.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓真和阿斯蘭出動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:16.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Tristan和Isolde瞄準左舷敵艦群
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:17.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.95,0:18:19.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘航母應該也在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.58,0:18:20.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,加緊搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.69,0:18:21.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.13,0:18:27.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,復仇之戰…也算不上吧 史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.84,0:18:31.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但今天一定要做掉那艘船
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.54,0:18:36.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史丁格 奧格雷  Chaos出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:41.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧 尼達  Abyss出動
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.55,0:18:48.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  核心戰機出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:28.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉  Saviour出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.54,0:19:40.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳真以為妳在那裡出現奧布軍就會撤退嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.21,0:19:45.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,妳該做的不是這種事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.47,0:19:50.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別再做那種事 回奧布去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.96,0:19:52.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.29,0:19:54.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:58.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.75,0:20:02.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拉克絲也說了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:03.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先下決心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:05.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再去行動
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:10.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是想成就某事時的唯一途徑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.27,0:20:12.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:14.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.55,0:20:18.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你非去不可 不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.04,0:20:29.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Archangel開始準備出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.49,0:20:32.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:35.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你還有其他該做的事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.01,0:20:37.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡讓我來坐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.23,0:20:39.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,米莉雅麗亞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.81,0:20:43.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,有你坐鎮這裡雖然讓人放心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:46.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但真的好嗎 好不容易…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:51.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 因為喜歡這個世界和人們所以才去拍照
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:54.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在他們都在危險之中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.12,0:20:57.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也要一起保護他們
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:02.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:50.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈  Strike rouge出動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.29,0:22:00.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉 大和  Freedom出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今でも氣付かないでしょう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,この靜かな空に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつでも思い出すけど
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,もうどこにももどれない
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そしてずっと心で醒めて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,そっと氣付いて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,いつかきっとやさしさ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見えてくるように
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's stopping me? I get stuck again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never OK for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,What's got into me? I get lost again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.14,0:00:00.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it really OK? It's never going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:25.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再次衝突的奧布和Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.97,0:23:27.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,言語 思想
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.90,0:23:30.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在炮火之前一切都只是幻影嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.91,0:23:32.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,互不相讓的想法顏色分明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.93,0:23:36.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,時間把朝向終結前進的每一刻記錄在指針上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.88,0:23:40.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在賭上一切的多數願望之前 卡嘉莉將…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.09,0:23:44.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集  機動戰士鋼彈 SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.71,0:23:46.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,留下的生命 消散的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:50.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,衝破混亂的天空 Murasame
